{"id":"710947804f01df45","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Topology Generated By Base","display":"df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base — ZFC Top4 Topology Generated By Base","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base — ZFC Top4 Topology Generated By Base","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base — ZFC Top4 Topology Generated By Base"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" href=\"?note=5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal B,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal B,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S\\)</span> is the canonical base-for-a-topology predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" href=\"?note=5b5ecc27cb1d76ae\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}topology\\text{-}generated\\text{-}by\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}topology\\text{-}generated\\text{-}by\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A topology is generated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> exactly when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> is a base for it; the canonical base predicate already includes the topology and refinement clauses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md","status":"resolved","id":"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md","status":"resolved","id":"5b5ecc27cb1d76ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S$ is the canonical base-for-a-topology predicate (see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top-base.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal B,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}topology\\text{-}generated\\text{-}by\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false}],"bytes":1071,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f1a6fd43bc566ac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (canonical predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base.md]])"},{"id":"7d71608bc30daeda","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop4TopologyGeneratedByBase}_S$ (generated-topology predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3583","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base.md|58-df-zfc-top4-topology-generated-by-base]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5b5ecc27cb1d76ae"]}